                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "The tenth badge, and you came back down to the sulfur? The terraces never cool for long. Ashclaw is always here to burn the rust off a champion."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Bring your best team down the Descent as often as you like. My Chandelure has a long memory and a longer flame. Any time you want the fire, it wants you."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Vexa - the terraces stay hot",
                    Label: "rematch_ready"
                },
