                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "The sulfur terraces hide nobody - the vents glow and the smoke parts for anyone fool enough to descend. I watched you pick your way down from the road. Settle it on the hot stone before the poison air does it for us."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "My Salazzle does not need to hit hard when the whole terrace is already burning your lungs. Battle quick, before the fumes count you out."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "You have the founder-face the Descent wardens toast in the dark. I will not say the name over an open vent. My fire asks the only question that matters."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Vexa Ashclaw",
                    Label: "default"
